  ('f71a7779-9f87-46fa-a269-275e4797349d', 'P25', 'Payment adjusted based on Medical Provider Network (MPN). Usage: If adjustment is at the Claim Level, the payer must send and the provider should refer to the 835 Class of Contract Code Identification Segment (Loop 2100 Other Claim Related Information REF). If adjustment is at the Line Level, the payer must send and the provider should refer to the 835 Healthcare Policy Identification Segment (loop 2110 Service Payment information REF) if the regulations apply. To be used for Property and Casualty only. (Use only with Group Code CO).', true, '2017-11-01'::timestamp, NULL, NULL, NULL, now(), now()),
